{"title":"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7ba10ee42f907faca7c14fa6bd9ebeb16f2012ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> be the set of all positive rational numbers. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52cf4828177313a5d64af569cc0790eae5f16e54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> be a function satisfying the following three conditions:\n</p><p>(i) for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c188f7a5acf4fecbcea883502b5282146590283.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad229fd4cdf2e7f7d5b3d6ac963b5a727f2a7fdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)f(y)\\geq f(xy)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />;\n(ii) for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c188f7a5acf4fecbcea883502b5282146590283.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/d/16db273dd729b159f651bc1c6ddfca8ba084b3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+y)\\geq f(x)+f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" />;\n(iii) there exists a rational number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8726d98aced2f3140dd77a2d8614c2e7674700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65ca28262d1839811dfac35a4384e450abe507c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/4874544e2638f3712dbb70e5ccf37558a5fc0acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/7923846db711108e80bdcb87a97d4ba1e61c1445.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO\" title=\"2013 IMO\">2013 IMO</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO\" title=\"2013 IMO\">2013 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017092942\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 93/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1317/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐ex